WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:02.450
- You were almost giving
up and working hard

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:04.270
as all artists do in the beginning,

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:05.960
and something made you not give up.

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:07.170
So, tell everybody what that was,

00:00:07.170 --> 00:00:09.400
'cause it's amazing.
- Aww.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.450
Yeah, so I'm like a year into Nashville,

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.310
and Nashville is...

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:15.510
I'm this young girl, I'm 18-years-old,

00:00:15.510 --> 00:00:17.843
I have no clue what I'm
doing, where to start.

00:00:19.369 --> 00:00:20.920
I'm about a year into town

00:00:20.920 --> 00:00:23.517
and crumbling just day by day.

00:00:23.517 --> 00:00:24.350
- Yeah.

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:27.097
- I called my sister
one day and I was like,

00:00:27.097 --> 00:00:30.447
"Hey, I have no clue
what I'm doing out here."

00:00:32.019 --> 00:00:33.670
It's just the whole, like,

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:36.860
if you come home, you
didn't fail, it's okay.

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:39.433
And that day, Taylor Swift was driving by.

00:00:41.220 --> 00:00:43.280
I was leaving work,

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:46.050
and I was wearing this
Taylor Swift t-shirt

00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:47.420
and she was just driving by

00:00:47.420 --> 00:00:49.357
and saw saw me standing
there and was like,

00:00:49.357 --> 00:00:51.970
"Hey! I love your shirt!"

00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:53.930
- I love that she did this!

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:54.763
- I know!

00:00:54.763 --> 00:00:56.840
And I'm like, what is my life, you know?

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.127
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- And it really-

00:00:58.127 --> 00:01:00.490
- But she had no idea the
impact that that would make

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:01.600
'cause you were thinking of quitting,

00:01:01.600 --> 00:01:04.540
and that had to have been like,
"This is a sign from God."

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:05.510
- Oh, it was crazy.

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:09.130
I'm like, "I'm quitting my
job, I'm quitting school,

00:01:09.130 --> 00:01:10.450
and I'm gonna go figure this out.

00:01:10.450 --> 00:01:12.490
I don't know how to do it,

00:01:12.490 --> 00:01:13.470
but I'm gonna figure it out."

00:01:13.470 --> 00:01:15.220
Like that doesn't even
happen, that doesn't happen!

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:16.230
- No, but sometimes you...

00:01:16.230 --> 00:01:19.120
No, that does not happen,
that's the craziest story ever.

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:21.040
But I think it's so cool,
and telling of her character.

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:22.630
That's very cool that
she did that, for one.

00:01:22.630 --> 00:01:23.790
And you have no idea

00:01:23.790 --> 00:01:25.460
the impact you'll make on someone's life,

00:01:25.460 --> 00:01:27.210
and how it will change their lives.

